<title>USA: Milestone Properties year loss.</title>
<headline>Milestone Properties year loss.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year end Dec. 31,</p>
<p>						   1996		 1995</p>
<p> Total Revenues		     $ 33,722,442     $ 25,767,510</p>
<p> Net (Loss) Income	     (   2,486,974)    (     809,649)</p>
<p> Preferred Stock Dividend    (	     0)    (   2,732,242)</p>
<p>Loss to Common Shareholders</p>
<p>				     (   2,486,974)    (   3,541,891)</p>
<p> Loss per Common Share	 (	  0.65)    (	  2.13)</p>
<p> Weighted Avg. Number of Shares   3,845,546	   1,664,956</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income for fiscal 1996 included an unrealized gain of $1,217,186 related to the company's subsidiary, Milestone Asset Management Inc, which entered into hedging transactions intended to mitigate the interest rate risk associated with its purchase of fixed interest rate, commercial mortgage pass-through certificates.</p>
<p>Net income was calculated before the payment of preferred dividends, earnings per share were calculated after the payment of preferred dividends.</p>
